    "title": "Erlanger Residents Demand Action on Pothole-Riddled Stevenson Road Near School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natalie Olafson ,\n21 hours ago Stevenson Rd. — Approximate Proposed Road Redesign Corridor. Dozens of Erlanger residents showed up to a town hall this week demanding answers about when the crumbling, pothole-scarred Stevenson Road will finally get fixed, with several calling it one of the worst streets in the city and a genuine danger to kids walking to school. Their frustration boiled over even though state officials announced tens of millions of dollars for the project two years ago. Read full article\n2",
